      "id": "overview",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "概览",
        "en": "Overview"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": {
                "zh-CN": "视觉权威",
                "en": "Visual Authority"
              },
              "body": {
                "zh-CN": "真实实现以 src/styles/tokens.css 与 design/HANDOFF.md 的稳定结论为准。",
                "en": "The implementation follows src/styles/tokens.css and stable conclusions in design/HANDOFF.md."
              }
            },
            {
              "label": {
                "zh-CN": "主状态",
                "en": "Main States"
              },
              "body": {
                "zh-CN": "empty、valid、invalid、AI-fix、history-restore、settings 六类状态需要一致。",
                "en": "empty, valid, invalid, AI-fix, history-restore, and settings states must remain consistent."
              }
            },
            {
              "label": {
                "zh-CN": "动效",
                "en": "Motion"
              },
              "body": {
                "zh-CN": "只做短时原生感 transition，尊重 prefers-reduced-motion，不动画 blur 半径。",
                "en": "Use short native-feeling transitions, respect prefers-reduced-motion, and do not animate blur radius."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "summary",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "摘要",
        "en": "Summary"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "本规格页记录当前实现应遵守的技术契约。若实现发生变化，需要同步更新本页和相关 plan/TODO/CHANGELIST。",
            "en": "This spec records the technical contract the current implementation should follow. If implementation changes, update this page and related plan/TODO/CHANGELIST."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
